                          PIPNODE PLUGINS
                          ===============

This file is a step-by-step guide to writing, building, installing,
and shipping plugins for pipnode.  It is aimed at programmers who
are comfortable in C but who have not necessarily worked with
pipnode, GObject, or dynamically loaded libraries before.

Read it top-to-bottom on a first pass; later sections assume the
vocabulary the earlier ones introduce.


